# Excalidraw (AstraDraw) — the keys stored in secrets.sops.json, one value each (`sopsgen
# apply` fills generated ones, `sopsedit` the rest). Values built from other
# secrets live in env.nix. Key set must match secrets.sops.json and
# tests/fixtures/stacks/excalidraw.sops.json.

# Postgres
# Read by the postgres image at first initdb and by the api's entrypoint. HEX
# on purpose: STORAGE_URI embeds it raw in a URL with no encoding layer.
# Rotating means changing STORAGE_URI in lockstep AND an ALTER USER in the
# container. openssl rand -hex 32
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=changeme_hex32

# Session
# Signs the astradraw_token cookie; rotating logs everyone out and nothing more.
# openssl rand -hex 32
JWT_SECRET=changeme_hex32
# Encrypts per-scene collab room keys at rest — separate from JWT_SECRET so a
# session rotation does not kill every collab room. Rotating THIS one does.
# openssl rand -hex 32
ROOM_KEY_SECRET=changeme_hex32

# Local admin
# Username `admin` (compose.yaml). Read at every boot, so changing it here and
# redeploying IS the password change. Break-glass login once OIDC is on.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=changeme_strong_password

